      "title": "Note: HearmemanAI",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Image, by HearmemanAI\n\nI build these workflows and post every one of them in my Discord. That is also the place to ask if something breaks:\n\nhttps://discord.gg/ZVWVhT43GW\n\nYou get this workflow already installed, with the models downloaded and the loaders pointed at them, on my MiniMax RunPod template:\n\nhttps://get.runpod.io/minimax-template\n\n### Editing\n\nAdd the picture you want to change first: it is image_1, <Picture 1> in the prompt. Pictures 2 to 9 are optional references. Say what should change and what must stay.\n\nMiniMax H3 Image does badly at low resolution, so image_1 is resized to 4 MP before the edit and the result comes out at that size. Raise megapixels on Output Size if your GPU has the memory; about 16 MP gives the best results.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## MiniMax H3 Image, by HearmemanAI\n\nI build these workflows and post every one of them in my Discord. That is also the place to ask if something breaks:\n\nhttps://discord.gg/ZVWVhT43GW\n\nYou get this workflow already installed, with the models downloaded and the loaders pointed at them, on my MiniMax RunPod template:\n\nhttps://get.runpod.io/minimax-template\n\n### Editing\n\nAdd the picture you want to change first: it is image_1, <Picture 1> in the prompt. Pictures 2 to 9 are optional references. Say what should change and what must stay.\n\nMiniMax H3 Image does badly at low resolution, so image_1 is resized to 4 MP before the edit and the result comes out at that size. Raise megapixels on Output Size if your GPU has the memory; about 16 MP gives the best results.\n"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
